# Homepage mounts this dir read-write and writes runtime files into it on start.
# The config-as-code SOURCE is the tracked *.yaml we author (settings, services,
# widgets, bookmarks). Everything Homepage auto-generates is runtime noise — keep
# it out of git. To author one of these intentionally, `git add -f` it + drop the
# line here.
logs/
*.log
custom.css
custom.js
docker.yaml
kubernetes.yaml
proxmox.yaml
